{"product_id":"circle-of-reason-the","title":"Circle Of Reason,The","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Circle Of Reason is a novel that documents the life of young Alu, who is a weaver by profession. His life takes a drastic turn when the young lad is wrongly accused of being a terrorist, and this causes him to flee from his village, after he is nearly arrested by the police. Constantly chased by a police inspector, the young lad flees from Bengal to Bombay, and continues his journey across the Persian Gulf until he reaches his last stop, North Africa. This captivating book has three parts and traces the life of the lead character across two continents.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 199\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Ghosh | Amitav\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780143066507\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 472\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45890760835225,"sku":"14RC9780143066507","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69156d08c9616_Circle_Of_Reason_The.jpg?v=1763046298","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/circle-of-reason-the","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}